 "why": "The helium-4 ladder again, every point, on the repaired supersymmetric pair potential. nuclei-3's runs at the top of 4D's window (Malfliet–Tjon s = 1.4993, Minnesota s = 1.8909) used a broken potential: there the forbidden state is bound by 300–500 MeV, its tail sank below what inverse iteration resolves, and the transformed potential came out hundreds of MeV deep out to 7 fm (one runner died on it). The tail now comes from the Riccati equation integrated inward; the transform keeps the spectrum to 0.05 MeV everywhere, and the healthy points are unchanged. Ours 2–6 helium-4s and 4D's 2–8, both forces.",
